{"name":"factions_greyish","seed":55,"config":{"rivalsByCount":true}}
# New Expedition seed 55 with Rival factions 3: a hive, a rival colony and
# the greyish, whose scout (fl1) lands first on their landfall Scorch Reach
# (sys_26, on the rim) with their mothership (fl2) parked in orbit of it.
# Jumping to the landfall would be an interception (factions_intercept), so
# meet the scout at its next stop instead: debug days 4 (the scout is still
# on Scorch Reach), then jump to Saffron Fold (sys_13, a moon, 51 fuel, a
# 17-day jump). The scout lifts off on day 10 and lands there on day 18, so
# the ship arrives on day 21 with it on the ground and no ship met on the way
# (it was landed when the jump began). From orbit the
# scout is seen, drawn on the Star Map as a saucer beside the site, tagged
# GREY SCOUT · HOSTILE. Beam one colonist down and land: the greys' landed
# saucer is built onto the level (the stamped hull, a locker of their own
# with the hold, the scout's modules: a grey vat and a console; phase E4)
# and three typed grey crew work it. Let the
# director print and mine a while, then frame the camp and look.
{"op":"wait","ticks":10}
{"op":"click","target":"title:new"}
{"op":"click","target":"title:name"}
{"op":"type","text":"Greys"}
{"op":"click","target":"title:seed"}
{"op":"type","text":"55"}
